      "latex_caption": "Changes of the generating tangent-plane projector during sphere motion. Blue shows $\\|P_t-P_{t-1}\\|_{\\mathrm F}$ in sensor coordinates; dark gray shows $\\|P_t-G_tP_{t-1}G_t^\\top\\|_{\\mathrm F}$ after compensating the measured frame rotation. Solid curves are arithmetic means over 256 Monte Carlo simulations at the 191 indices $t=2,3,\\ldots,192$; the initial normal and resulting physical path vary across simulations. No confidence band is displayed. The compensated increment equals the world-frame projector increment within each simulation."
